t 2's recommendation, propose Candidate B as better overall, citing strengths and noting concerns but perhaps less severe than D's hot temper. Provide evidence.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 2's point: they said D strongest overall despite hot temper. We'll say I see strengths in D but hot temper is a serious safety risk, and B offers comparable strengths with fewer crew cooperation concerns.\n\nWe must include explicit candidate facts: B is very conscientious, handles stress very well, good at assessing weather conditions, excellent computer skills. D's hot temper and know-it-all attitude. Also D's strengths: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously. We'll argue that B's reliability and stress handling outweigh D's problem solving, and D's hot temper is a bigger risk.\n\nThus our vote: Candidate B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
