 at taking criticism.\" \"C can be unorganized.\" \"C is sometimes not good at taking criticism.\" \"C can anticipate dangerous situations.\" \"C is able to see complex connections.\" \"C has excellent spatial vision.\" \"C has very good leadership qualities.\"\n\nWe need to decide our recommendation. Likely B still best, but we need to discuss A and C. Perhaps we can argue that A's reliability and crew atmosphere are strong, but communication difficulty and egocentric may be problematic. C's situational awareness and leadership are strong, but unorganized and unfriendly are concerns. So B remains best. So we can keep vote for B, but bring up A and C for discussion, maybe suggest that they are less suitable.\n\nThus our public message: we agree with Agent 3's recommendation of B, but we want to discuss A and C to ensure coverage. Provide evidence: A's reliability and positive crew atmosphere vs communication issues; C's anticipation and leadership vs unorganized and unfriendly. Conclude that B still best.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote B.\n\nProceed."}
