tress handling, technical competence. Also D's hot temper is a serious crew cooperation issue. So we might reconsider and shift to B.\n\nWe need to reference explicit facts: D's hot temper, know-it-all attitude, and lack of decision quality evidence. B's very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills. Also B's pretentiousness and occasional wrong tone are concerns but perhaps less severe.\n\nThus we can say we now recommend Candidate B, because the lack of decision quality evidence for D and his hot temper outweigh his problem solving. Provide reasoning.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate B\".\n\nProceed."}
