es Candidate B. So we should likely keep vote B, maybe reinforce. Also need to bring up any remaining under-discussed candidates A and C, but we have already discussed them earlier. However we still need to ensure coverage before final convergence. The SMM says still need deeper evaluation of decision quality, stress resilience, technical competence, responsibility, adaptability for A and C. But we can still bring up a point about A or C to compare with B, maybe to confirm B remains best. Provide evidence: A's reliability and positive crew atmosphere but communication issues; C's anticipation and leadership but unfriendly and unorganized. Conclude B still best.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Markus and Sofia, keep recommendation B, explain why A and C are less suitable. Provide explicit facts: A 100% reliable, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, but difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. C anticipates dangerous situations, sees complex connections, leadership, but unfriendly, unorganized, not good at taking criticism. B's strengths outweigh concerns.\n\nVote B.\n\nProceed."}
